# Every source file in this repo is LF, and the site is served from GitHub Pages
# where that is what matters. Declaring it here means a checkout on Windows, or an
# editor that rewrites a file wholesale, cannot quietly flip a file to CRLF and
# turn one edited line into a diff of the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures must never be touched.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
